  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "remove 3D preview from in game avatar menu (all models are being loaded when this is opened and these models are the full versions so it is the same as being in a 60+ users map with no safety settings applied (even with no own avatars uploaded)\n\noptimize local cache loading (please do not let the game load the same world objects from servers if the files exist locally in the cache as is now the case)\n\nAdd suggestion in sdk or add this to the automated optimization section prior to upload to bake as much as possible into the model (this reduces drawcalls a ton (The specialized VRM format uses this and gets up to 100 000 k tris with 25 materials and 4k textures at 90-150 fps with ease due to this)",
